
Pkg
---

.. ada:set_package:: Pkg


.. ada:function:: function Classify (X : Standard.Integer) return Standard.Integer
    :package: Pkg

    **Contracts**
       :contract_cases: ``(X > 0    => Classify'Result =  1,
         X = 0    => Classify'Result =  0,
         others   => Classify'Result = -1)``

    :spark_mode: ``Off``
.. ada:aspect:: Contract_Cases => X > 0 => Classify'Result = 1 on Pkg.Classify
.. ada:aspect:: Contract_Cases => X = 0 => Classify'Result = 0 on Pkg.Classify
.. ada:aspect:: Contract_Cases => others => Classify'Result = -1 on Pkg.Classify

    Contract_Cases: whole aggregate AND per-case breakdown.
